    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.clue\n\n### Description\n\nHello!\r\n\r\nI always forget the keys for diff operations, specifically <kbd>do</kbd> and <kbd>dp</kbd>.\r\n\r\nWould you consider adding these to mini.clue as `MiniClue.gen_clues.diff()` or similar? I can work on a PR if that's helpful. If it doesn't make sense to include, all good, I can just include in my personal config.\r\n\r\nThanks for your time.",
