    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nI think it makes more sense to leave it to the users to define these clues. The main reason for this is that they need `d` trigger enabled, but it would conflict with `d` operator.\r\n\r\nOn first glance (if my memory serves me right) this might be even impossible to properly set up with 'mini.clue'. If you manage to make it work, please leave a comment with you setup.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
