        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Here is a config snippet, all seems to work smoothly and I haven't noticed any side effects. Thanks for all your amazing plugins!\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nlocal miniclue = require \"mini.clue\"\r\nminiclue.setup {\r\n  triggers = {\r\n    -- `d` key (Diff)\r\n    { mode = \"n\", keys = \"d\" },\r\n  },\r\n  clues = {\r\n    { desc = \"Diff obtain\", keys = \"do\", mode = \"n\" },\r\n    { desc = \"Diff put\", keys = \"dp\", mode = \"n\" },\r\n  },\r\n}\r\n```",
